Hand for simulations of progressively built models for breathing and swallowing interactions.

Model parameters are descibed in rCPGswCPG/model_params
Each file generates pickle file with model parameters that then could be then loaded.

rCPGswCPG/protocols/protocols.py defines experimental schedules for external stimulation (similar to real experiments).
see run_model.py for one example and
experiments/variation_single_param.py for another example.

